<title>JAPAN: Okinawa Electric - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Okinawa Electric - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 67.91		vs	   67.44</p>
<p> Operating	    7.35		vs	    7.48</p>
<p> Current		1.36		vs	    1.41</p>
<p> Net		  593 million	 vs	  733 million</p>
<p> EPS		   39.88 yen	  vs	   49.79 yen</p>
<p> Shares		15 million	 vs	   15 million</p>
<p> Interim div	 25.00 yen	  vs	   25.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Okinawa Electric Power Co Inc supplies electricity to the Okinawan archipelago.</p>
</text>
